    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/763cfe8c-0875-4dbc-b284-7b334d3cd156-01/SelectionCriterion$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria1>,
